<title>AUSTRALIA: Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - May 2.</title>
<headline>Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - May 2.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Thursday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Centro Prop	    16.16     2.15</p>
<p> 2   Mt Leyshon Gold	13.16     1.90</p>
<p> 3   Prime Credit Tr	 9.90     0.99</p>
<p> 4   Aust Tour		 9.62     0.78</p>
<p> 5   Natl Consol	     9.47     0.95</p>
<p> 6   Prop Income Inv	 9.26     1.09</p>
<p> 7   Villa World	     9.01     1.11</p>
<p> 8   BT Prop Trust	   8.97     1.82</p>
<p> 9   Equitilink		8.77     0.57</p>
<p>10   Colonial Mutual	 8.67     1.23</p>
<p>11   Indu Property	   8.66     0.98</p>
<p>12   Gen Prop Tr	     8.63     2.33</p>
<p>13   Countrywide-PP	  8.54     1.19</p>
<p>14   Hills Inds		8.47     2.02</p>
<p>15   Schroder Prop	   8.41     2.20</p>
